WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.213 --> 00:00:05.122
(suspenseful music)

00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:09.512
- I hope he can guess
it, but if he doesn't

00:00:10.858 --> 00:00:12.026
I won't dump him.

00:00:12.026 --> 00:00:13.848
- It might throw a wrench in
that whole one year thing.

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:15.160
- No.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.394
- So we'll see.

00:00:16.394 --> 00:00:21.102
