00:02:26.768 --> 00:02:27.732
I think that we're pretty awesome

00:02:27.732 --> 00:02:29.430
with being boyfriend
and girlfriend, right?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:30.169
- Yeah.

00:02:30.169 --> 00:02:31.533
- There you go.

